#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:119
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_CUSTOMBRANDTEXT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_CUSTOMBRANDTEXT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:136
msgid "Enable Ask Community link"
msgstr "Ask Community 링크 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:139
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** A link to the `Mattermost Community "
"<https://mattermost.com/community/>`__ appears as **Ask the community** "
"under the **Help** menu in the channel header."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** `Mattermost Community <https://mattermost.com/community/>`__에 대한 링크가 채널 헤더의 **Help** 메뉴 아래에 **Ask the community**로 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:140
msgid "**false**: The link does not appear."
msgstr "**false**: 링크가 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:142
msgid "The link does not display on mobile apps."
msgstr "이 링크는 모바일 앱에는 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:140
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``EnableAskCommunityLink``"
" > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``EnableAskCommunityLink`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:141
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_ENABLEASKCOMMUNITYLINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_ENABLEASKCOMMUNITYLINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:153
msgid "Help link"
msgstr "Help 링크"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:156
msgid ""
"This field sets the URL for the Help link on the login and sign up pages,"
" as well as the **Help Resources** link under the **Help** menu in the "
"channel header."
msgstr "이 필드는 로그인 및 회원가입 페이지의 Help 링크와 채널 헤더의 **Help** 메뉴 아래 **Help Resources** 링크에 대한 URL을 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:158
msgid "String input. Default is ``https://about.mattermost.com/default-help/``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``https://about.mattermost.com/default-help/``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:157
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``HelpLink``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``HelpLink``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:158
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_HELPLINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_HELPLINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:162
msgid ""
"If this value is empty, the Help link is hidden on the login and sign up "
"pages. However, the **Help Resources** link remains available under the "
"**Help** menu."
msgstr "이 값이 비어 있으면 로그인 및 회원가입 페이지에서 Help 링크가 숨겨집니다. 다만 **Help Resources** 링크는 **Help** 메뉴 아래에 계속 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:172
msgid "Terms of Use link"
msgstr "이용 약관 링크"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:175
msgid ""
"This field sets the URL for the Terms of Use of a self-hosted site. A "
"link to the terms appears at the bottom of the sign-up and login pages."
msgstr "이 필드는 셀프 호스팅 사이트의 이용 약관 URL을 설정합니다. 약관에 대한 링크는 회원가입 및 로그인 페이지 하단에 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:177
msgid ""
"The default URL links to a `Terms of Use <https://mattermost.com/terms-"
"of-use/>`__ page hosted on ``mattermost.com``. This includes the "
"Mattermost Acceptable Use Policy explaining the terms under which "
"Mattermost software is provided to end users. If you change the default "
"link to add your own terms, the new terms **must include a link** to the "
"default terms so end users are aware of the Mattermost Acceptable Use "
"Policy."
msgstr "기본 URL은 ``mattermost.com``에서 호스팅되는 `이용 약관 <https://mattermost.com/terms-of-use/>`__ 페이지로 연결됩니다. 여기에는 Mattermost 소프트웨어가 최종 사용자에게 제공되는 조건을 설명하는 Mattermost 사용 제한 정책(Acceptable Use Policy)이 포함되어 있습니다. 기본 링크를 변경하여 자체 약관을 추가하는 경우, 최종 사용자가 Mattermost 사용 제한 정책을 인지할 수 있도록 새 약관에 **반드시 기본 약관에 대한 링크를 포함해야** 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:179
msgid "String input. Default is ``https://about.mattermost.com/default-terms/``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``https://about.mattermost.com/default-terms/``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:176
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``TermsOfServiceLink``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``TermsOfServiceLink``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:177
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_TERMSOFSERVICELINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_TERMSOFSERVICELINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:183
msgid ""
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription may replace or override the "
"Acceptable Use Policy with their own acceptable use or conduct policies, "
"based on contractual terms with Mattermost, so long as your own terms "
"either incorporate the Acceptable Use Policy or include equivalent terms."
" If you change the default link to add your own terms for using the "
"service you provide, your new terms must include a `link to the default "
"terms <https://mattermost.com/terms-of-use/#acceptable-use-policy>`_ so "
"end users are aware of the Mattermost Acceptable Use Policy for "
"Mattermost software."
msgstr "Mattermost 구독을 보유한 고객은 Mattermost와의 계약 조건에 따라 사용 제한 정책(Acceptable Use Policy)을 자체 사용 제한 또는 행동 정책으로 대체하거나 재정의할 수 있으며, 이때 자체 약관에 사용 제한 정책을 포함하거나 동등한 약관을 포함해야 합니다. 기본 링크를 변경하여 제공하는 서비스 이용에 대한 자체 약관을 추가하는 경우, 최종 사용자가 Mattermost 소프트웨어에 대한 Mattermost 사용 제한 정책을 인지할 수 있도록 새 약관에 `기본 약관에 대한 링크 <https://mattermost.com/terms-of-use/#acceptable-use-policy>`_를 포함해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:184
msgid ""
"This setting is applicable to self-hosted deployments only and doesn't "
"change the **Terms of Use** link in the **About Mattermost** window."
