#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:203
msgid ""
"This setting is applicable to self-hosted deployments only and doesn't "
"change the **Privacy Policy** link in the **About Mattermost** window."
msgstr "이 설정은 셀프 호스팅 배포에만 적용되며 **About Mattermost** 창의 **Privacy Policy** 링크는 변경하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:213
