#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:232
msgid "Forgot Password custom link"
msgstr "비밀번호 찾기 사용자 지정 링크"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:235
msgid ""
"When the **Forgot Password** link is enabled on the Mattermost login "
"page, users are taken to a custom URL to recover or change their "
"password."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 로그인 페이지에서 **Forgot Password** 링크가 활성화되어 있으면, 사용자는 비밀번호를 복구하거나 변경하기 위해 사용자 지정 URL로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:238
msgid "Leave this field blank to use Mattermost's Password Reset workflow."
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 비밀번호 재설정 워크플로를 사용하려면 이 필드를 비워 둡니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:235
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Forgot password custom link**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Forgot password custom link**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:236
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``ForgetPasswordLink``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``ForgetPasswordLink``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:237
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_FORGETPASSWORDLINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_FORGETPASSWORDLINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:242
msgid ""
"This configuration setting applies to all Mattermost clients, including "
"web, desktop app, and mobile app. You can control whether the **Forgot "
"Password** link is visible or hidden in clients by going to "
"**Authentication > Password > Enable Forgot Password Link**. See the "
":ref:`configuration <administration-guide/configure/authentication-"
"configuration-settings:enable forgot password link>` documentation for "
"details."
msgstr "이 설정은 웹, 데스크톱 앱, 모바일 앱을 포함한 모든 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에 적용됩니다. **Authentication > Password > Enable Forgot Password Link**로 이동하여 클라이언트에서 **Forgot Password** 링크를 표시할지 숨길지 제어할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`설정 <administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable forgot password link>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:252
msgid "Report a Problem"
msgstr "문제 보고"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:254
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can specify how the **Report a "
"Problem** option behaves in the Mattermost app via the **Help** menu:"
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **Help** 메뉴를 통해 OKR.BEST 앱의 **Report a Problem** 옵션이 어떻게 동작할지 지정할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Default link**: Uses the default Mattermost URL to report a problem. "
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription are directed to the `Mattermost "
"Support Portal <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. "
"Community deployments are directed to `create a new issue on the "
"Mattermost GitHub repository "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/new>`_."
msgstr "**Default link**: 문제를 보고하기 위한 기본 Mattermost URL을 사용합니다. Mattermost 구독을 보유한 고객은 `Mattermost Support Portal <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_로 안내됩니다. 커뮤니티 배포는 `Mattermost GitHub 저장소에 새 이슈 생성 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/new>`_으로 안내됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:257
msgid ""
"**Email address**: Enables you to :ref:`enter an email address "
"<administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:report a "
"problem email address>` that users will be prompted to send a message to "
"when they choose **Report a Problem** in Mattermost."
msgstr "**Email address**: 사용자가 OKR.BEST에서 **Report a Problem**을 선택할 때 메시지를 보내도록 안내할 :ref:`이메일 주소 입력 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:report a problem email address>`을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:258
msgid ""
"**Custom link**: Enables you to :ref:`enter a URL <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:report a problem link>` that "
"users will be directed to when they choose **Report a Problem** in "
"Mattermost."
msgstr "**Custom link**: 사용자가 OKR.BEST에서 **Report a Problem**을 선택할 때 이동할 :ref:`URL 입력 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:report a problem link>`을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:259
msgid "**Hide link**: Removes the **Report a Problem** option from Mattermost."
msgstr "**Hide link**: OKR.BEST에서 **Report a Problem** 옵션을 제거합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:269
msgid "Report a Problem link"
msgstr "문제 보고 링크"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:272
msgid ""
"This field sets the URL for the **Report a Problem** link in the channel "
"header **Help** menu. If this field is empty the link does not appear."
msgstr "이 필드는 채널 헤더 **Help** 메뉴의 **Report a Problem** 링크에 대한 URL을 설정합니다. 이 필드가 비어 있으면 링크가 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:275
msgid "String input. Default is ``https://mattermost.com/pl/report-a-bug``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``https://mattermost.com/pl/report-a-bug``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:273
