#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:274
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_REPORTAPROBLEMLINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_REPORTAPROBLEMLINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:289
msgid "Report a Problem email address"
msgstr "문제 보고 이메일 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:292
msgid ""
"This field sets the email address for the **Report a Problem** link in "
