msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``ReportAProblemMail``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:294
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_REPORTAPROBLMEMAIL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_REPORTAPROBLMEMAIL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:309
msgid "Allow mobile app log downloads"
msgstr "모바일 앱 로그 다운로드 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:312
msgid ""
"Enable users to download mobile app logs for troubleshooting. When the "
"**Report a Problem** link is shown, mobile logs can be downloaded as part"
" of the reporting flow."
msgstr "문제 해결을 위해 사용자가 모바일 앱 로그를 다운로드할 수 있도록 합니다. **Report a Problem** 링크가 표시되면 보고 흐름의 일부로 모바일 로그를 다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:316
msgid "**true** (**Default**): Users can download mobile app logs."
msgstr "**true** (**기본값**): 사용자가 모바일 앱 로그를 다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:317
msgid "**false** Users can't download mobile app logs."
msgstr "**false** 사용자가 모바일 앱 로그를 다운로드할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:313
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``AllowDownloadLogs``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``AllowDownloadLogs``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:314
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_ALLOWDOWNLOADLOGS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_ALLOWDOWNLOADLOGS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:331
