#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:753
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Localization**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Localization**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:502
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LocalizationSettings`` > "
"``DefaultServerLocale``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LocalizationSettings`` > ``DefaultServerLocale``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:503
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_DEFAULTSERVERLOCALE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_DEFAULTSERVERLOCALE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:512
msgid ""
"Changing this configuration setting changes the default server language "
"for users who haven't set a language preference via **Settings**. "
"Mattermost applies the user's language preference when specified."
msgstr "이 설정을 변경하면 **Settings**를 통해 언어 기본 설정을 지정하지 않은 사용자의 기본 서버 언어가 변경됩니다. 사용자가 언어 기본 설정을 지정한 경우 OKR.BEST는 해당 설정을 적용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:523
msgid "Default client language"
msgstr "기본 클라이언트 언어"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:526
msgid ""
"The default language for new users and pages where the user isn't logged "
"in."
msgstr "신규 사용자와 사용자가 로그인하지 않은 페이지의 기본 언어입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:527
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LocalizationSettings`` > "
"``DefaultClientLocale``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LocalizationSettings`` > ``DefaultClientLocale``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:528
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_DEFAULTCLIENTLOCALE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_DEFAULTCLIENTLOCALE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:537
msgid ""
"Changing this configuration setting changes the default client language "
"for users who haven't set a language preference via **Settings**. "
"Mattermost applies the user's language preference when specified."
msgstr "이 설정을 변경하면 **Settings**를 통해 언어 기본 설정을 지정하지 않은 사용자의 기본 클라이언트 언어가 변경됩니다. 사용자가 언어 기본 설정을 지정한 경우 OKR.BEST는 해당 설정을 적용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:547
msgid "Available languages"
msgstr "사용 가능한 언어"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:550
msgid ""
"Sets the list of languages users see under **Settings > Display > "
"Language**. If this field is left blank, users see all supported "
"languages. Newly supported languages are added automatically. If this "
"field is not blank, it must contain the **Default client language**, in "
"addition to any other languages. For example, to limit the language "
"choices to US English and Español (es), the string would be "
"``\"en,es\"``."
msgstr "**Settings > Display > Language** 아래에 사용자가 보게 되는 언어 목록을 설정합니다. 이 필드를 비워 두면 사용자에게 지원되는 모든 언어가 표시됩니다. 새로 지원되는 언어는 자동으로 추가됩니다. 이 필드가 비어 있지 않은 경우, 다른 언어와 함께 **Default client language**를 반드시 포함해야 합니다. 예를 들어 언어 선택을 US English와 Español(es)로 제한하려면 문자열이 ``\"en,es\"``가 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:551
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LocalizationSettings`` > ``AvailableLocales``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LocalizationSettings`` > ``AvailableLocales``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:552
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_AVAILABLELOCALES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONSETTINGS_AVAILABLELOCALES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:576
msgid "Enable experimental locales"
msgstr "실험적 로케일 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:578
msgid ""
"Enable work in progress languages in Mattermost to review translations "
"and identify translation gaps."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 작업 중인 언어를 활성화하여 번역을 검토하고 번역 누락 부분을 식별합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:581
msgid ""
"**true**: Work in progress languages are available in Mattermost in "
"addition to officially supported languages."
msgstr "**true**: 공식적으로 지원되는 언어 외에 작업 중인 언어를 OKR.BEST에서 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:584
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Only officially supported languages are "
"available in Mattermost."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 공식적으로 지원되는 언어만 OKR.BEST에서 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:582
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LocalizationSettings`` > "
"``EnableExperimentalLocales`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LocalizationSettings`` > ``EnableExperimentalLocales`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:583
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONETTINGS_ENABLEEXPERIMENTALLOCALES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOCALIZATIONETTINGS_ENABLEEXPERIMENTALLOCALES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:590
msgid ""
"Cloud system admins can request this configuration setting to be enabled "
"for their instance by contacting their Mattermost Account Manager."
msgstr "Cloud 시스템 관리자는 Mattermost 계정 관리자에게 문의하여 자신의 인스턴스에 이 설정을 활성화하도록 요청할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:591
msgid ""
"Work in progress languages may be incomplete. Strings missing "
"translations display in US English."
msgstr "작업 중인 언어는 불완전할 수 있습니다. 번역이 누락된 문자열은 US English로 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:592
msgid ""
"Currently, only web and desktop app product strings are impacted by this "
"configuration setting. Server and mobile product strings aren't impacted "
"by this setting."
msgstr "현재 이 설정의 영향을 받는 것은 웹 및 데스크톱 앱 제품 문자열뿐입니다. 서버 및 모바일 제품 문자열은 이 설정의 영향을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:593
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`language <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-"
"options:language>` documentation for details on selecting a language "
"preference in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 언어 기본 설정을 선택하는 방법에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`언어 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options:language>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:600
msgid "Auto-translation"
msgstr "자동 번역"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-adv.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise Advanced "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ plans"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise Advanced <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ 플랜에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:605
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > Localization**. These settings configure "
"automatic translation of channel messages. See the :doc:`Auto-translation"
" setup guide </administration-guide/manage/admin/autotranslation>` for "
"deployment details."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Site Configuration > Localization**으로 이동하여 다음 설정에 접근합니다. 이 설정은 채널 메시지의 자동 번역을 구성합니다. 배포 세부 정보는 :doc:`자동 번역 설정 가이드 </administration-guide/manage/admin/autotranslation>`를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:618
msgid "Enable auto-translation"
msgstr "자동 번역 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:621
msgid "Enable or disable automatic translation of channel messages."
msgstr "채널 메시지의 자동 번역을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:623
msgid "**true**: Autotranslation is available and can be enabled per channel."
msgstr "**true**: 자동 번역을 사용할 수 있으며 채널별로 활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:625
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Autotranslation is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 자동 번역이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:622
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Enable`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:623
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:636
msgid "Translation provider"
msgstr "번역 공급자"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:639
msgid "The translation provider to use for autotranslation."
msgstr "자동 번역에 사용할 번역 공급자입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:641
msgid ""
"``libretranslate``: Use a self-hosted LibreTranslate server for "
"translations."
msgstr "``libretranslate``: 번역을 위해 셀프 호스팅 LibreTranslate 서버를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:643
msgid ""
"``agents``: Use the Mattermost Agents plugin with an LLM backend for "
"translations."
msgstr "``agents``: 번역을 위해 LLM 백엔드가 포함된 Mattermost Agents 플러그인을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:646
msgid "Default is ``\"\"`` (no provider selected)."
msgstr "기본값은 ``\"\"``입니다(공급자가 선택되지 않음)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:640
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Provider``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Provider``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:641
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_PROVIDER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_PROVIDER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:657
msgid "LibreTranslate URL"
msgstr "LibreTranslate URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:660
msgid ""
"The URL of the LibreTranslate server used for translations. The "
"Mattermost server must be able to reach this URL."
msgstr "번역에 사용되는 LibreTranslate 서버의 URL입니다. OKR.BEST 서버가 이 URL에 도달할 수 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:663
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:681
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:699
msgid "String value."
msgstr "문자열 값."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:661
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``LibreTranslate``"
" > ``URL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``LibreTranslate`` > ``URL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:663
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_LIBRETRANSLATE_URL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_LIBRETRANSLATE_URL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:674
msgid "LibreTranslate API key"
msgstr "LibreTranslate API 키"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:677
msgid ""
"The API key for authenticated access to the LibreTranslate server. Leave "
"blank if the LibreTranslate server doesn't require authentication."
msgstr "LibreTranslate 서버에 인증된 접근을 위한 API 키입니다. LibreTranslate 서버에 인증이 필요하지 않으면 비워 둡니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:678
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``LibreTranslate``"
" > ``APIKey``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``LibreTranslate`` > ``APIKey``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:680
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_LIBRETRANSLATE_APIKEY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_LIBRETRANSLATE_APIKEY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:692
msgid "Agents LLM service ID"
msgstr "Agents LLM 서비스 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:695
msgid ""
"The service ID of the LLM configured in the Mattermost Agents plugin to "
"use for translations. Configure LLM services in the Agents plugin "
"settings."
msgstr "번역에 사용할 Mattermost Agents 플러그인에 구성된 LLM의 서비스 ID입니다. Agents 플러그인 설정에서 LLM 서비스를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:696
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Agents`` > "
"``LLMServiceID``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Agents`` > ``LLMServiceID``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:698
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_AGENTS_LLMSERVICEID``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_AGENTS_LLMSERVICEID``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:710
msgid "Languages allowed"
msgstr "허용된 언어"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:713
msgid ""
"The languages that all messages in autotranslation-enabled channels are "
"translated into. Every message is translated into each language in this "
"list, regardless of who is in the channel. Specify languages as an array "
"of language codes."
msgstr "자동 번역이 활성화된 채널의 모든 메시지가 번역되는 대상 언어입니다. 채널에 누가 있든 관계없이 모든 메시지가 이 목록의 각 언어로 번역됩니다. 언어는 언어 코드 배열로 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:718
msgid "Default is ``[\"en\"]``."
msgstr "기본값은 ``[\"en\"]``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:714
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``TargetLanguages``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``TargetLanguages``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:715
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_TARGETLANGUAGES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_TARGETLANGUAGES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:729
msgid "Translation timeout"
msgstr "번역 시간 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid ""
"The maximum time in milliseconds to wait for a translation to complete. "
"If a translation exceeds this timeout, it is skipped."
msgstr "번역이 완료될 때까지 기다리는 최대 시간(밀리초)입니다. 번역이 이 시간 제한을 초과하면 건너뜁니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:736
msgid "Numerical value. Default is **5000** (5 seconds)."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **5000**입니다(5초)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:733
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``TimeoutMs`` > "
"``5000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``TimeoutMs`` > ``5000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:734
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_TIMEOUTMS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_TIMEOUTMS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:750
msgid "Restrict autotranslation in direct and group messages"
msgstr "개인 메시지 및 그룹 메시지에서 자동 번역 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:753
msgid "Restrict autotranslation from being enabled in direct and group messages."
msgstr "개인 메시지 및 그룹 메시지에서 자동 번역이 활성화되지 않도록 제한합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:756
msgid "**true**: Autotranslation can't be enabled in direct or group messages."
msgstr "**true**: 개인 메시지 또는 그룹 메시지에서 자동 번역을 활성화할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:758
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Autotranslation can be enabled in direct and "
"group messages."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 개인 메시지 및 그룹 메시지에서 자동 번역을 활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:754
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > "
"``RestrictDMAndGM`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``RestrictDMAndGM`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:755
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_RESTRICTDMANDGM``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_RESTRICTDMANDGM``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:770
msgid "Translation workers"
msgstr "번역 워커"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:773
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent translation workers per node. Higher values "
"increase translation throughput but use more resources. This setting is "
"not available in the System Console and can only be set via ``mmctl``, "
"``config.json``, or environment variable."
msgstr "노드당 동시 번역 워커 수입니다. 값이 높을수록 번역 처리량이 증가하지만 더 많은 리소스를 사용합니다. 이 설정은 관리자 도구에서 사용할 수 없으며 ``mmctl``, ``config.json`` 또는 환경 변수를 통해서만 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:779
msgid "Numerical value. Default is **6**."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **6**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:773
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Workers`` > ``6``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``AutoTranslationSettings`` > ``Workers`` > ``6``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:774
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_WORKERS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_AUTOTRANSLATIONSETTINGS_WORKERS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:785
msgid "Users and teams"
msgstr "사용자와 팀"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:787
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > Users and Teams**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Site Configuration > Users and Teams**로 이동하여 다음 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:797
msgid "Max users per team"
msgstr "팀당 최대 사용자 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:800
msgid ""
"The **Max users per team** is the maximum total number of users per team,"
" including activated and deactivated users."
msgstr "**Max users per team**은 활성화 및 비활성화된 사용자를 포함하여 팀당 최대 총 사용자 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:803
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, a team of people should be a small organization with a "
"specific goal. In the physical world, a team could sit around a single "
"table. The default maximum (50) should be enough for most teams, but with"
" appropriate `hardware <https://docs.mattermost.com/install/ software-"
"hardware-requirements.html>`__, this limit can be increased to thousands "
"of users."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 팀은 특정 목표를 가진 소규모 조직이어야 합니다. 물리적 세계에서 팀은 하나의 테이블에 둘러앉을 수 있는 규모입니다. 기본 최대값(50)은 대부분의 팀에 충분하지만, 적절한 `하드웨어 <https://docs.mattermost.com/install/ software-hardware-requirements.html>`__가 있으면 이 제한을 수천 명의 사용자로 늘릴 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:810
msgid ""
":doc:`Channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels>`"
" are another way of organizing communications within teams on various "
"topics."
msgstr ":doc:`채널 </end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels>`은 다양한 주제에 대해 팀 내 커뮤니케이션을 구성하는 또 다른 방법입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:813
msgid ""
"Numerical input. Default is **50** self-hosted deployments, and **10000**"
" for Cloud deployments."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 셀프 호스팅 배포의 경우 **50**, Cloud 배포의 경우 **10000**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:800
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:828
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:848
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:872
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:894
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:928
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:948
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:991
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1013
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1040
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1059
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1078
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1094
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Users and Teams**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Users and Teams**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:801
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``MaxUsersPerTeam`` > ``50``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``MaxUsersPerTeam`` > ``50``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:802
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_MAXUSERSPERTEAM``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_MAXUSERSPERTEAM``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:825
msgid "Max channels per team"
msgstr "팀당 최대 채널 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:828
msgid ""
"The maximum number of channels per team, including both active and "
"archived channels."
msgstr "활성 채널과 보관된 채널을 모두 포함하여 팀당 최대 채널 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:830
msgid ""
"Numerical input. Default is **2000** for self-hosted deployments, and "
"**10000** for Cloud deployments."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 셀프 호스팅 배포의 경우 **2000**, Cloud 배포의 경우 **10000**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:829
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``MaxChannelsPerTeam`` > "
"``2000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``MaxChannelsPerTeam`` > ``2000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:830
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_MAXCHANNELSPERTEAM``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_MAXCHANNELSPERTEAM``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:845
msgid "Enable join/leave messages by default"
msgstr "기본적으로 참여/나가기 메시지 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:848
msgid ""
"Specify the default configuration of system messages displayed when users"
" join or leave channels."
msgstr "사용자가 채널에 참여하거나 나갈 때 표시되는 시스템 메시지의 기본 구성을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:851
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Join/Leave messages are displayed."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 참여/나가기 메시지가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:852
msgid "**false**: Join/Leave messages are hidden."
msgstr "**false**: 참여/나가기 메시지가 숨겨집니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:854
msgid ""
"Users can override this default by going to **Settings > Advanced > "
"Enable Join/Leave Messages**."
msgstr "사용자는 **Settings > Advanced > Enable Join/Leave Messages**로 이동하여 이 기본값을 재정의할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:849
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > "
"``EnableJoinLeaveMessageByDefault`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableJoinLeaveMessageByDefault`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:850
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEJOINLEAVEMESSAGEBYDEFAULT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEJOINLEAVEMESSAGEBYDEFAULT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:869
msgid "Enable users to open direct message channels with"
msgstr "개인 메시지 채널을 열 수 있는 대상"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:872
msgid ""
"This setting determines whether a user can open a direct message channel "
"with anyone on the Mattermost server or only to members of the same team."
" This setting only affects the options presented in the user interface. "
"It does not affect permissions on the backend server."
msgstr "이 설정은 사용자가 OKR.BEST 서버의 모든 사람과 개인 메시지 채널을 열 수 있는지, 아니면 같은 팀의 구성원과만 열 수 있는지를 결정합니다. 이 설정은 사용자 인터페이스에 제시되는 옵션에만 영향을 미칩니다. 백엔드 서버의 권한에는 영향을 미치지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:874
msgid ""
"**Any user on the Mattermost server**: **(Default)** Users can send a "
"direct message to any user through the **Direct Messages > More** menu. "
"``config.json`` setting: ``\"any\"``"
msgstr "**Any user on the Mattermost server**: **(기본값)** 사용자는 **Direct Messages > More** 메뉴를 통해 모든 사용자에게 개인 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"any\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:876
msgid ""
"**Any member of the team**: The **Direct Messages > More** menu only "
"allows direct messages to users on the same team. Pressing :kbd:`Ctrl` "
":kbd:`K` on Windows or Linux, or :kbd:`⌘` :kbd:`K` on Mac, only lists "
"other users on the team currently being viewed. A user who is a member of"
" multiple teams can only send direct messages to the team that is being "
"viewed. However, the user can receive messages from other teams, "
"regardless of the team currently being viewed. ``config.json`` setting: "
"``\"team\"``"
msgstr "**Any member of the team**: **Direct Messages > More** 메뉴에서는 같은 팀의 사용자에게만 개인 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다. Windows 또는 Linux에서 :kbd:`Ctrl` :kbd:`K`를, Mac에서 :kbd:`⌘` :kbd:`K`를 누르면 현재 보고 있는 팀의 다른 사용자만 표시됩니다. 여러 팀에 속한 사용자는 현재 보고 있는 팀에만 개인 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다. 다만 현재 보고 있는 팀에 관계없이 다른 팀으로부터 메시지를 받을 수는 있습니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"team\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:873
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``RestrictDirectMessage``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``RestrictDirectMessage``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:874
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_RESTRICTDIRECTMESSAGE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_RESTRICTDIRECTMESSAGE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:891
msgid "Teammate name display"
msgstr "팀 동료 이름 표시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:894
msgid ""
"This setting determines how names appear in posts and under the **Direct "
"Messages** list. Users can change this setting in their interface under "
"**Settings > Display > Teammate Name Display**, unless this setting is "
"locked by a system admin via the **Lock teammate name display for all "
"users** configuration setting."
msgstr "이 설정은 게시물과 **Direct Messages** 목록 아래에 이름이 표시되는 방식을 결정합니다. **Lock teammate name display for all users** 설정을 통해 시스템 관리자가 이 설정을 잠그지 않은 한, 사용자는 인터페이스의 **Settings > Display > Teammate Name Display**에서 이 설정을 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:899
msgid ""
"**Show username**: **(Default for self-hosted deployments)** Displays "
"usernames. ``config.json`` option: ``\"username\"``."
msgstr "**Show username**: **(셀프 호스팅 배포의 기본값)** 사용자 ID를 표시합니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"username\"``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:901
msgid ""
"**Show nickname if one exists...**: Displays the user's nickname. If the "
"user doesn't have a nickname, their full name is displayed. If the user "
"doesn't have a full name, their username is displayed. ``config.json`` "
"option: ``\"nickname_full_name\"``."
msgstr "**Show nickname if one exists...**: 사용자의 닉네임을 표시합니다. 사용자에게 닉네임이 없으면 전체 이름이 표시됩니다. 사용자에게 전체 이름이 없으면 사용자 ID가 표시됩니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"nickname_full_name\"``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:904
msgid ""
"**Show first and last name**: **(Default for Cloud deployments)** "
"Displays user's full name. If the user doesn't have a full name, their "
"username is displayed. Recommended when using :doc:`SAML "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml>` or :doc:`LDAP </administration-"
"guide/onboard/ad-ldap>` if first name and last name attributes are "
"configured. ``config.json`` option: ``\"full_name\"``."
msgstr "**Show first and last name**: **(Cloud 배포의 기본값)** 사용자의 전체 이름을 표시합니다. 사용자에게 전체 이름이 없으면 사용자 ID가 표시됩니다. 이름 및 성 속성이 구성되어 있다면 :doc:`SAML </administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml>` 또는 :doc:`LDAP </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap>`을 사용할 때 권장됩니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"full_name\"``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:895
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``TeammateNameDisplay`` > "
"``username``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``TeammateNameDisplay`` > ``username``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:896
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_TEAMMATENAMEDISPLAY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_TEAMMATENAMEDISPLAY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:922
msgid "Lock teammate name display for all users"
msgstr "모든 사용자에 대해 팀 동료 이름 표시 잠금"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-plus.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans"
" <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:928
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether users can change settings under **Settings "
"> Display > Teammate Name Display**."
msgstr "이 설정은 사용자가 **Settings > Display > Teammate Name Display** 아래의 설정을 변경할 수 있는지를 제어합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:930
msgid "**true**: Users **cannot** change the Teammate Name Display."
msgstr "**true**: 사용자가 팀 동료 이름 표시를 변경할 수 **없습니다**."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:931
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Users can change the Teammate Name Display "
"setting."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 팀 동료 이름 표시 설정을 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:929
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``LockTeammateNameDisplay`` >"
" ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``LockTeammateNameDisplay`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:930
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_LOCKTEAMMATENAMEDISPLAY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_LOCKTEAMMATENAMEDISPLAY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:945
msgid "Allow users to view archived channels"
msgstr "사용자가 보관된 채널을 볼 수 있도록 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:948
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Allows users to access the content of archived "
"channels of which they were a member."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 자신이 구성원이었던 보관된 채널의 콘텐츠에 접근할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:949
msgid "**false**: Users are unable to access content in archived channels."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자가 보관된 채널의 콘텐츠에 접근할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:949
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > "
"``ExperimentalViewArchivedChannels`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``ExperimentalViewArchivedChannels`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:950
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_EXPERIMENTALVIEWARCHIVEDCHANNELS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_EXPERIMENTALVIEWARCHIVEDCHANNELS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:954
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11, this configuration setting is always enabled and no "
"longer configurable. Users can always access archived channels where they"
" are members."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11부터 이 설정은 항상 활성화되어 있으며 더 이상 구성할 수 없습니다. 사용자는 자신이 구성원인 보관된 채널에 항상 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:955
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1147
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1181
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1206
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1267
msgid "Cloud admins can't modify this configuration setting."
msgstr "Cloud 관리자는 이 설정을 수정할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:968
msgid "Show email address"
msgstr "이메일 주소 표시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:971
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** All users can see the email addresses of every "
"other user."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 모든 사용자가 다른 모든 사용자의 이메일 주소를 볼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:972
msgid ""
"**false**: Hides email addresses in the client user interface, except "
"from system admins and the System Roles with read/write access to "
"Compliance, Billing, or User Management (users/teams/channels/groups "
"etc)."
msgstr "**false**: 시스템 관리자와 컴플라이언스, 결제 또는 사용자 관리(사용자/팀/채널/그룹 등)에 대한 읽기/쓰기 권한이 있는 시스템 역할을 제외하고, 클라이언트 사용자 인터페이스에서 이메일 주소를 숨깁니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:971
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Users and teams**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Users and teams**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:972
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``ShowEmailAddress`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``ShowEmailAddress`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:973
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_SHOWEMAILADDRESS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_SHOWEMAILADDRESS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:988
msgid "Show full name"
msgstr "전체 이름 표시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:991
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Full names are visible to all users in the client"
" user interface."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 클라이언트 사용자 인터페이스에서 모든 사용자에게 전체 이름이 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:992
msgid ""
"**false**: Hides full names from all users, except system admins. "
"Username is shown in place of the full name."
msgstr "**false**: 시스템 관리자를 제외한 모든 사용자에게서 전체 이름을 숨깁니다. 전체 이름 대신 사용자 ID가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:992
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``ShowFullName`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``ShowFullName`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:993
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_SHOWFULLNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_SHOWFULLNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1007
msgid "Enable anonymous team and channel URLs"
msgstr "익명 팀 및 채널 URL 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1013
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.6.0, when enabled, team and channel URLs are "
"anonymized, meaning the URL no longer contains the team or channel name. "
"This prevents team and channel names from being identified through web "
"addresses."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.6.0부터, 활성화하면 팀 및 채널 URL이 익명화되어 URL에 팀 또는 채널 이름이 더 이상 포함되지 않습니다. 이를 통해 웹 주소를 통해 팀 및 채널 이름이 식별되는 것을 방지합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1017
msgid ""
"When this setting is enabled, the team and channel creation workflows no "
"longer include a step for users to define a URL; teams and channels are "
"created with an automatically generated anonymous URL. This applies only "
"to newly created teams and channels; existing teams and channels are not "
"affected."
msgstr "이 설정을 활성화하면 팀 및 채널 생성 워크플로에 사용자가 URL을 정의하는 단계가 더 이상 포함되지 않으며, 팀과 채널은 자동으로 생성된 익명 URL로 만들어집니다. 이는 새로 생성된 팀과 채널에만 적용되며, 기존 팀과 채널은 영향을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1022
msgid "**true**: Team and channel URLs are anonymized."
msgstr "**true**: 팀 및 채널 URL이 익명화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1023
msgid "**false**: Team and channel URLs include the team or channel name."
msgstr "**false**: 팀 및 채널 URL에 팀 또는 채널 이름이 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1014
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``UseAnonymousURLs``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``PrivacySettings`` > ``UseAnonymousURLs``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1015
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_USEANONYMOUSURLS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_PRIVACYSETTINGS_USEANONYMOUSURLS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1037
msgid "Enable custom user statuses"
msgstr "사용자 정의 상태 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1040
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Users can set status messages and emojis that are"
" visible to all users."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 모든 사용자에게 표시되는 상태 메시지와 이모지를 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1041
msgid "**false**: Users cannot set custom statuses."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자가 사용자 정의 상태를 설정할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1041
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableCustomUserStatuses`` "
"> ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableCustomUserStatuses`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1042
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLECUSTOMUSERSTATUSES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLECUSTOMUSERSTATUSES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1056
msgid "Enable last active time"
msgstr "마지막 활동 시간 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1059
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Users can see when deactivated users were last "
"active on a user's profile and in direct message channel headers."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 비활성화된 사용자가 마지막으로 활동한 시간을 사용자 프로필과 개인 메시지 채널 헤더에서 볼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1061
msgid "**false**: Users can't see when deactivated users were last online."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자가 비활성화된 사용자가 마지막으로 온라인 상태였던 시간을 볼 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1060
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableLastActiveTime`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableLastActiveTime`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1061
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLELASTACTIVETIME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLELASTACTIVETIME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1075
msgid "Enable custom user groups"
msgstr "사용자 정의 사용자 그룹 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1078
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Users with appropriate permissions can create "
"custom user groups, and users can @mention custom user groups in "
"Mattermost conversations."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 적절한 권한이 있는 사용자가 사용자 정의 사용자 그룹을 생성할 수 있으며, 사용자는 OKR.BEST 대화에서 사용자 정의 사용자 그룹을 @멘션할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1080
msgid "**false**: Custom user groups cannot be created."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자 정의 사용자 그룹을 생성할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1079
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableCustomGroups`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableCustomGroups`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1080
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLECUSTOMGROUPS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLECUSTOMGROUPS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1091
msgid "User statistics update time"
msgstr "사용자 통계 업데이트 시간"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1094
msgid ""
"Set the server time for updating the user post statistics, including each"
" user's total message count, and the timestamp of each user's most "
"recently sent message."
msgstr "각 사용자의 총 메시지 수와 각 사용자가 가장 최근에 보낸 메시지의 타임스탬프를 포함한 사용자 게시물 통계를 업데이트하는 서버 시간을 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1097
msgid ""
"Must be a 24-hour time stamp in the form ``HH:MM`` based on the local "
"time of the server. Default is **00:00**."
msgstr "서버의 로컬 시간을 기준으로 ``HH:MM`` 형식의 24시간 타임스탬프여야 합니다. 기본값은 **00:00**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1095
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``RefreshPostStatsRunTime`` > ``00:00``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``RefreshPostStatsRunTime`` > ``00:00``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1096
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_REFRESHPOSTSTATSRUNTIME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_REFRESHPOSTSTATSRUNTIME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1104
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "알림"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1106
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > Notifications**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Site Configuration > Notifications**로 이동하여 다음 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1119
msgid "Show @channel, @all, or @here confirmation dialog"
msgstr "@channel, @all 또는 @here 확인 대화 상자 표시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1122
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Requires users to confirm when posting @channel, "
"@all, @here, or group mentions in channels with more than 5 members."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 구성원이 5명을 초과하는 채널에서 @channel, @all, @here 또는 그룹 멘션을 게시할 때 사용자에게 확인을 요구합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1123
msgid "**false**: No confirmation is required."
msgstr "**false**: 확인이 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1122
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1141
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1175
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1197
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1229
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1245
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1261
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1280
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1296
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1312
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1333
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Notifications**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Notifications**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1123
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > "
"``EnableConfirmNotificationsToChannel`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableConfirmNotificationsToChannel`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1124
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLECONFIRMNOTIFICATIONSTOCHANNEL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLECONFIRMNOTIFICATIONSTOCHANNEL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1138
msgid "Enable email notifications"
msgstr "이메일 알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1141
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Enables automatic email notifications for posts."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 게시물에 대한 자동 이메일 알림을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1142
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables notifications. A developer may choose this option to "
"speed development by skipping email setup (see also the **Enable preview "
"mode banner** setting)."
msgstr "**false**: 알림을 비활성화합니다. 개발자는 이메일 설정을 건너뛰어 개발 속도를 높이기 위해 이 옵션을 선택할 수 있습니다(**Enable preview mode banner** 설정도 참고)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1142
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``SendEmailNotifications`` >"
" ``ture``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``SendEmailNotifications`` > ``ture``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1143
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SENDEMAILNOTIFICATIONS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SENDEMAILNOTIFICATIONS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1148
msgid ""
"If this setting is **false**, and the SMTP server is set up, account-"
"related emails (such as authentication messages) will be sent regardless "
"of this setting."
msgstr "이 설정이 **false**이고 SMTP 서버가 설정되어 있으면, 계정 관련 이메일(인증 메시지 등)은 이 설정에 관계없이 전송됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1149
msgid ""
"Email invitations and account deactivation emails aren't affected by this"
" setting."
msgstr "이메일 초대 및 계정 비활성화 이메일은 이 설정의 영향을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1150
msgid ""
"If you don't plan on :doc:`configuring Mattermost for email "
"</administration-guide/configure/smtp-email>`, disabling this "
"configuration setting in larger deployments may improve server "
"performance in the following areas, particularly in high-traffic "
"environments where performance is a key concern:"
msgstr ":doc:`OKR.BEST의 이메일 구성 </administration-guide/configure/smtp-email>`을 계획하고 있지 않다면, 대규모 배포에서 이 설정을 비활성화하면 특히 성능이 주요 관심사인 트래픽이 많은 환경에서 다음 영역의 서버 성능이 향상될 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1152
msgid ""
"**Reduced Server Load**: Generating and sending emails requires "
"processing power and resources. By disabling email notifications, you "
"reduce the load on the server, which can be reallocated to other tasks."
msgstr "**서버 부하 감소**: 이메일을 생성하고 전송하는 데에는 처리 능력과 리소스가 필요합니다. 이메일 알림을 비활성화하면 서버 부하가 줄어들어 다른 작업에 재할당할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1153
msgid ""
"**Decreased I/O Operations**: Sending emails involves input/output (I/O) "
"operations, such as writing to logs and databases, and handling "
"communication with the email server. Reducing these I/O operations can "
"improve overall system efficiency."
msgstr "**I/O 작업 감소**: 이메일 전송에는 로그 및 데이터베이스 쓰기, 이메일 서버와의 통신 처리 등 입출력(I/O) 작업이 포함됩니다. 이러한 I/O 작업을 줄이면 전체 시스템 효율성이 향상될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1154
msgid ""
"**Lowered Network Traffic**: Each email sent contributes to network "
"traffic. Disabling email notifications decreases the amount of data being"
" transmitted, which can lead to better performance, especially in "
"environments with limited bandwidth."
msgstr "**네트워크 트래픽 감소**: 전송되는 각 이메일은 네트워크 트래픽에 영향을 미칩니다. 이메일 알림을 비활성화하면 전송되는 데이터 양이 줄어들어, 특히 대역폭이 제한된 환경에서 성능이 향상될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1155
msgid ""
"**Faster Response Times**: With fewer background tasks (like sending "
"emails) to handle, the application can potentially respond to user "
"requests more quickly, improving perceived performance."
msgstr "**응답 시간 단축**: 처리할 백그라운드 작업(이메일 전송 등)이 줄어들면, 애플리케이션이 사용자 요청에 더 빠르게 응답할 수 있어 체감 성능이 향상됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1156
msgid ""
"**Resource Allocation**: Resources like CPU cycles, memory, and network "
"bandwidth that would have been used for sending emails can be used "
"elsewhere, possibly improving the performance of other critical "
"components of the system."
msgstr "**리소스 할당**: 이메일 전송에 사용되었을 CPU 사이클, 메모리, 네트워크 대역폭과 같은 리소스를 다른 곳에 사용할 수 있어, 시스템의 다른 중요한 구성 요소의 성능을 향상시킬 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1157
msgid ""
"However, disabling email notifications can negatively impact user "
"experience, communication efficiency, and overall productivity. It's "
"important to balance performance improvements with the needs of your "
"organization and users."
msgstr "그러나 이메일 알림을 비활성화하면 사용자 경험, 커뮤니케이션 효율성, 전반적인 생산성에 부정적인 영향을 줄 수 있습니다. 성능 개선과 조직 및 사용자의 요구 사항 간에 균형을 맞추는 것이 중요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1172
msgid "Enable preview mode banner"
msgstr "미리 보기 모드 배너 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1175
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** When **Send email notifications** is **false**, "
"users see the Preview Mode banner. This banner alerts users that email "
"notifications are disabled."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** **Send email notifications**가 **false**일 때 사용자에게 미리 보기 모드 배너가 표시됩니다. 이 배너는 이메일 알림이 비활성화되어 있음을 사용자에게 알립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1176
msgid "**false**: Preview Mode banner does not appear."
msgstr "**false**: 미리 보기 모드 배너가 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1176
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnablePreviewModeBanner`` "
"> ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnablePreviewModeBanner`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1177
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLEPREVIEWMODEBANNER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLEPREVIEWMODEBANNER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1194
msgid "Enable email batching"
msgstr "이메일 일괄 처리 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1197
msgid ""
"**true**: Multiple email notifications for mentions and direct messages "
"over a given time period are batched into a single email."
msgstr "**true**: 일정 기간 동안 멘션 및 개인 메시지에 대한 여러 이메일 알림이 하나의 이메일로 일괄 처리됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1200
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Email notifications are sent for each mention or"
" direct message."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 각 멘션 또는 개인 메시지마다 이메일 알림이 전송됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1198
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableEmailBatching`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableEmailBatching`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1199
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLEEMAILBATCHING``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLEEMAILBATCHING``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1207
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Site Url <administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"configuration-settings:site url>` and :ref:`SMTP Email Server "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:smtp "
"server>` must be configured to allow email batching."
msgstr "이메일 일괄 처리를 허용하려면 :ref:`Site Url <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:site url>` 및 :ref:`SMTP Email Server <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:smtp server>`가 구성되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1208
msgid ""
"Regardless of how this setting is configured, users can :ref:`disable "
"email-based notifications altogether <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-notifications:email notifications>`."
msgstr "이 설정이 어떻게 구성되어 있든 관계없이, 사용자는 :ref:`이메일 기반 알림을 완전히 비활성화 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications:email notifications>`할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1209
msgid ""
"When email batching is enabled, users can :ref:`customize how often to "
"receive batched notifications <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications:email notifications>`. The default frequency is 15 minutes."
msgstr "이메일 일괄 처리가 활성화되면 사용자는 :ref:`일괄 알림을 받는 빈도를 사용자 지정 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications:email notifications>`할 수 있습니다. 기본 빈도는 15분입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1210
msgid ""
"Email batching in :ref:`High Availability Mode <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:enable high "
"availability mode>` is planned, but not yet supported."
msgstr ":ref:`고가용성 모드 <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:enable high availability mode>`에서의 이메일 일괄 처리는 계획되어 있으나 아직 지원되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1223
msgid "Email notification contents"
msgstr "이메일 알림 내용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1229
msgid ""
"**Send full message contents**: **(Default)** Email notifications include"
" the full message contents, along with the name of the sender and the "
"channel. ``config.json`` setting: ``\"full\"``"
msgstr "**Send full message contents**: **(기본값)** 이메일 알림에 발신자 이름 및 채널과 함께 전체 메시지 내용이 포함됩니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"full\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1231
msgid ""
"**Send generic description with only sender name**: Only the name of the "
"sender and team name are included in email notifications. Use this option"
" if Mattermost contains confidential information and policy dictates it "
"cannot be stored in email. ``config.json`` setting: ``\"generic\"``"
msgstr "**Send generic description with only sender name**: 이메일 알림에 발신자 이름과 팀 이름만 포함됩니다. OKR.BEST에 기밀 정보가 포함되어 있고 정책상 이메일에 저장할 수 없는 경우 이 옵션을 사용합니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"generic\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1230
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > "
"``EmailNotificationContentsType``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EmailNotificationContentsType``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1231
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_EMAILNOTIFICATIONCONTENTSTYPE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_EMAILNOTIFICATIONCONTENTSTYPE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1242
msgid "Notification display name"
msgstr "알림 표시 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1245
msgid "Display name for email notifications sent from the Mattermost system."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템에서 전송되는 이메일 알림의 표시 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1247
msgid ""
"String input. No default setting. This field is required when changing "
"settings in the System Console."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본 설정이 없습니다. 관리자 도구에서 설정을 변경할 때 이 필드는 필수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1246
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackName``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackName``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1247
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1258
msgid "Notification from address"
msgstr "알림 발신 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1261
msgid ""
"Email address for notification emails from the Mattermost system. This "
"address should be monitored by a system admin."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템에서 보내는 알림 이메일의 이메일 주소입니다. 이 주소는 시스템 관리자가 모니터링해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1263
msgid ""
"String input. Default is ``test@example.com``. This field is required "
"when changing settings in the System Console."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``test@example.com``입니다. 관리자 도구에서 설정을 변경할 때 이 필드는 필수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1262
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackEmail``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackEmail``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1263
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKEMAIL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKEMAIL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1277
msgid "Support email address"
msgstr "지원 이메일 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1280
msgid ""
"Sets a user support (or feedback) email address that is displayed on "
"email notifications and during the Getting Started tutorial. This address"
" should be monitored by a system admin. If no value is set, email "
"notifications will not contain a way for users to request assistance."
msgstr "이메일 알림과 시작하기 튜토리얼 중에 표시되는 사용자 지원(또는 피드백) 이메일 주소를 설정합니다. 이 주소는 시스템 관리자가 모니터링해야 합니다. 값을 설정하지 않으면 이메일 알림에 사용자가 지원을 요청할 수 있는 방법이 포함되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1282
msgid ""
"String input. Default is ``feedback@mattermost.com``. This field is "
"required when changing settings in the System Console."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``feedback@mattermost.com``입니다. 관리자 도구에서 설정을 변경할 때 이 필드는 필수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1281
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SupportSettings`` > ``SupportEmail``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SupportSettings`` > ``SupportEmail``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1282
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_SUPPORTEMAIL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_SUPPORTEMAIL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1293
msgid "Notification reply-to address"
msgstr "알림 회신 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1296
msgid ""
"Email address used in the reply-to header when sending notification "
"emails from the Mattermost system. This address should be monitored by a "
"system admin."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템에서 알림 이메일을 보낼 때 reply-to 헤더에 사용되는 이메일 주소입니다. 이 주소는 시스템 관리자가 모니터링해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1298
msgid "String input. Default is ``test@example.com``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``test@example.com``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1297
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``ReplyToAddress``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``ReplyToAddress``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1298
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_REPLYTOADDRESS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_REPLYTOADDRESS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1309
msgid "Notification footer mailing address"
msgstr "알림 푸터 우편 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1312
msgid ""
"Optional setting to include the organization's name and mailing address "
"in the footer of email notifications. If not set, nothing will appear."
msgstr "이메일 알림의 푸터에 조직의 이름과 우편 주소를 포함하는 선택적 설정입니다. 설정하지 않으면 아무것도 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1313
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackOrganization``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``FeedbackOrganization``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1314
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKORGANIZATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_FEEDBACKORGANIZATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1330
msgid "Push notification contents"
msgstr "푸시 알림 내용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1333
msgid ""
"**Generic description with only sender name**: Push notifications include"
" the sender's name, but not the channel name or message contents. "
"``config.json`` setting: ``\"generic_no_channel\"``"
msgstr "**Generic description with only sender name**: 푸시 알림에 발신자 이름이 포함되지만 채널 이름이나 메시지 내용은 포함되지 않습니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"generic_no_channel\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1336
msgid ""
"**Generic description with sender and channel names**: **(Default)** Push"
" notifications include the name of the sender and channel, but not the "
"message contents. ``config.json`` setting: ``\"generic\"``"
msgstr "**Generic description with sender and channel names**: **(기본값)** 푸시 알림에 발신자 이름과 채널 이름이 포함되지만 메시지 내용은 포함되지 않습니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"generic\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1340
msgid ""
"**Full message content sent in the notification payload**: Includes the "
"message contents in the push notification payload, which may be sent "
"through `Apple's Push Notification service "
"<https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications>`__ or "
"`Google's Firebase Cloud Messaging <https://firebase. google.com/docs"
"/cloud-messaging>`__ . We **highly recommended** this option only be used"
" with an ``https`` protocol to encrypt the connection and protect "
"confidential information. ``config.json`` setting: ``\"full\"``"
msgstr "**Full message content sent in the notification payload**: 푸시 알림 페이로드에 메시지 내용이 포함되며, 이는 `Apple's Push Notification service <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications>`__ 또는 `Google's Firebase Cloud Messaging <https://firebase. google.com/docs/cloud-messaging>`__를 통해 전송될 수 있습니다. 연결을 암호화하고 기밀 정보를 보호하기 위해 이 옵션은 ``https`` 프로토콜과 함께만 사용할 것을 **강력히 권장합니다**. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"full\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1348
msgid ""
"**Full message content fetched from the server on receipt** (*Available "
"in Mattermost Enterprise*): The notification payload contains no message "
"content. Instead it contains a unique message ID used to fetch message "
"content from the Mattermost server when a push notification is received "
"via a `notification service app extension "
"<https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/ modifying-"
"content-in-newly-delivered-notifications>`_  on iOS or `an expandable "
"notification pattern "
"<https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/expanded>`_"
" on Android."
msgstr "**Full message content fetched from the server on receipt** (*Mattermost Enterprise에서 사용 가능*): 알림 페이로드에 메시지 내용이 포함되지 않습니다. 대신 iOS의 `notification service app extension <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/ modifying-content-in-newly-delivered-notifications>`_ 또는 Android의 `확장 가능한 알림 패턴 <https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/expanded>`_을 통해 푸시 알림을 수신할 때 OKR.BEST 서버에서 메시지 내용을 가져오는 데 사용되는 고유한 메시지 ID가 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1355
msgid ""
"If the server cannot be reached, a generic push notification is displayed"
" without message content or sender name. For customers who wrap the "
"Mattermost mobile application in a secure container, the container must "
"fetch the message contents using the unique message ID when push "
"notifications are received."
msgstr "서버에 도달할 수 없는 경우, 메시지 내용이나 발신자 이름 없이 일반 푸시 알림이 표시됩니다. OKR.BEST 모바일 애플리케이션을 보안 컨테이너로 래핑하는 고객의 경우, 푸시 알림을 수신할 때 컨테이너가 고유한 메시지 ID를 사용하여 메시지 내용을 가져와야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1360
msgid ""
"If the container is unable to execute the fetch, the push notification "
"contents cannot be received by the customer's mobile application without "
"passing the message contents through Apple's or Google's notification "
"service. ``config.json`` setting: ``\"id_loaded\"``"
msgstr "컨테이너가 가져오기를 실행할 수 없는 경우, 메시지 내용을 Apple 또는 Google의 알림 서비스를 통해 전달하지 않고는 고객의 모바일 애플리케이션에서 푸시 알림 내용을 수신할 수 없습니다. ``config.json`` 설정: ``\"id_loaded\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1334
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``PushNotificationContents``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``PushNotificationContents``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1335
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_PUSHNOTIFICATIONCONTENTS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_PUSHNOTIFICATIONCONTENTS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1376
msgid "Enable notification monitoring"
msgstr "알림 모니터링 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1379
msgid "Enable or disable notification metrics data collection."
msgstr "알림 메트릭 데이터 수집을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1382
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Mattermost notification data collection is "
"enabled for client-side web and desktop app users."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 클라이언트 측 웹 및 데스크톱 앱 사용자에 대해 OKR.BEST 알림 데이터 수집이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1385
msgid "**false**: Mattermost notification data collection is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: OKR.BEST 알림 데이터 수집이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1379
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Performance Monitoring**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Performance Monitoring**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1380
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > "
"``EnableNotificationMetrics`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``EnableNotificationMetrics`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1381
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLENOTIFICATIONMETRICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLENOTIFICATIONMETRICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1390
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`performance monitoring <administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring:getting started>` "
"documentation to learn more about Mattermost Notification Health metrics."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 알림 상태 메트릭에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`성능 모니터링 <administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring:getting started>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1396
msgid "System-wide notifications"
msgstr "시스템 전체 알림"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1401
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > System-wide notifications**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Site Configuration > System-wide notifications**로 이동하여 다음 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1414
msgid "Enable system-wide notifications"
msgstr "시스템 전체 알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1417
msgid ""
