"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > Emoji**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Site Configuration > Emoji**로 이동하여 다음 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1509
msgid "Enable emoji picker"
msgstr "이모지 선택기 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1512
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Enables an emoji picker when composing messages "
"and for message reactions."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 메시지를 작성할 때와 메시지 반응에 대해 이모지 선택기를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1513
msgid "**false**: Disables the emoji picker in message composition and reactions."
msgstr "**false**: 메시지 작성 및 반응에서 이모지 선택기를 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1512
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1531
