"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableEmojiPicker`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableEmojiPicker`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1514
